Z||000032||Formula||10-26-2001||11:08 AM||||my cars getting jealous because everyone is showing off there clear tailights, so I told it I would post a pic.  I did these about a year and a hlaf ago. (btw, would red neon light tubes hold up to being used as brake lights if I put them in the bucket and put red strobes in for the turn signals?)<P>here it is!<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/docu0004.jpg">  <P>I thought I would dig up my how to thread on it too.  <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20010924-1-006083.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20010924-1-006083.html</A> <p>[This message has been edited by Formula (edited 10-26-2001).]||||reg||1
